== 9. Verdict against the pre-set criterion ====================

  RASSF9: COMPOSITION
    pooled core rho        -0.383 (p = 2.34e-27, n = 741)
    shore rho              +0.520
    distal rho             +0.291
    lineage-adjusted       84% retained, p = 1.56e-15
    within-lineage         median rho -0.369, negative in 17 of 17
    conditions met: pooled TRUE | specificity FALSE | adjustment TRUE | within-lineage TRUE

  RASSF10: SUPPORTED
    pooled core rho        -0.562 (p = 5.44e-63, n = 741)
    shore rho              -0.418
    distal rho             +0.157
    lineage-adjusted       88% retained, p = 2.47e-22
    within-lineage         median rho -0.484, negative in 16 of 17
    conditions met: pooled TRUE | specificity TRUE | adjustment TRUE | within-lineage TRUE

